DESCRIPTION:Confused about the future of AI and accelerating technology? W
 ondering what to believe and how you can show up and find community in thi
 s strange time?\nYou're invited to an evening that blends fun\, snacks\, a
 nd serious questions about our future\, with themed drinks and thoughtful 
 company.\n\n​What to Expect:\n\n​🌀 Debate: “AI Hope vs Doom: Whic
 h future is more likely?”\nAt 6:40\, we’ll host a playful but real deb
 ate between Team Hope and Team Doom — framed around the future\, tech\, 
 and justice. Audience participation encouraged (and rewarded)!\n\n​💬 
 Processing Circles + Real Action\nWe’ll close with small group reflectio
 n and a concrete invitation to move your money\, time\, and power toward j
 ustice through Blue Heart.\n\n​💙 This event is part social\, part sal
 on\, part soft call to action. Whether you're deep in the giving game or n
 ew to these convos\, this is a low-pressure space to reflect and connect.
 \n\n​🎭 A dress code invitation: match your outfit to your outlook! We
 ar brighter colors or sparkling accents if you’re feeling optimistic abo
 ut our future\, and darker tones if not.\n\n​Themed drinks & snacks prov
 ided (mocktails\, fruit & cheese platter)\n\n​Why Now?\n\n​Things are 
 weird. AI is moving fast\, the world feels chaotic\, it's harder to tell w
 hat's actually real\, and the future is uncertain. But we can still do thi
 ngs that matter. This evening is about making space for that conversation 
 — and building community around action.\n\n​Spots are limited — plea
 se reserve yours by July 15. Come curious\, leave inspired.\n\n​Hosted b
 y: Eva & Stacey\nIn collaboration with Blue Heart 💙\nLearn more here: B
 lue Heart\n\nhttps://www.blueheartaction.org/\nhttps://lu.ma/zwzjugh8
